 drivers/leds/rgb/Kconfig           |  11 +
 drivers/leds/rgb/Makefile          |   1 +
 drivers/leds/rgb/leds-is32fl3207.c | 687 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 700 insertions(+)
